1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,750
In March, the council in Muhos voted yes.

2
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:03,100
Outside, it rained. One resident appealed.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,850
In September, Doodle promised thirteen billion euros.

4
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,300
Part of it for local biodiversity.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,050
Then the forest at Muhos came down.

6
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:09,550
About 330 hectares, by the company’s own count.

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,250
The biodiversity was stacked neatly.

8
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,750
Above 200 hectares, the law asks for an assessment first.

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,450
On the seventh of October, the regulator said stop.

10
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:15,950
Until the impact assessment is done.

11
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:17,100
About a hundred came to Doodle’s door.

12
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,150
Fifty thousand signed an initiative to parliament.

